          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.142,
            0.61,
            0.162
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Creative Chitti",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " has some questions for you —"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.182,
            0.166,
            0.848,
            0.222
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(a) You have to make exactly 30 button presses. What is the largest 3-digit number you can make? What is the smallest 3-digit number you can make?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 5,
          "bbox": [
            0.183,
            0.227,
            0.593,
            0.282
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "(b) 997 can be made using 25 clicks. Can you make 997 with a different number of clicks?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 6,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.288,
            0.592,
            0.325
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Create questions like these and challenge your classmates."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 7,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.325,
            0.594,
            0.4
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Systematic Sippy",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " is a different kind of calculator. It has the following buttons: +1, +10, +100, +1000, +10000, +100000. It wants to be used as minimally as possible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "index": 8,
          "bbox": [
            0.605,
            0.227,
            0.87,
            0.375
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "image_body",
              "index": 8,
              "bbox": [
                0.605,
                0.227,
                0.87,
                0.375
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_image_8.jpg",
              "content": ""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 9,
          "bbox": [
            0.111,
            0.408,
            0.846,
            0.446
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "？ How can we get the numbers (a) 5072, (b) 8300 using as few button clicks as possible?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 10,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.458,
            0.535,
            0.55
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Find out which buttons should be clicked and how many times to get the desired numbers given in the table. The aim is to click as few buttons as possible."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 11,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.55,
            0.533,
            0.605
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Here is one way to get the number 5072. This method uses 23 button clicks in total."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 12,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.605,
            0.532,
            0.661
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Is there another way to get 5072 using less than 23 button clicks? Write the expression for the same."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "index": 13,
          "bbox": [
            0.112,
            0.669,
            0.292,
            0.692
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Figure it Out"
            }
          ],
          "level": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 14,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.695,
            0.534,
            0.788
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. For the numbers in the previous exercise, find out how to get each number by making the smallest number of button clicks and write the expression."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "table",
          "index": 15,
          "bbox": [
            0.559,
            0.451,
            0.848,
            0.746
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "table_body",
              "index": 15,
              "bbox": [
                0.559,
                0.451,
                0.848,
                0.746
              ],
              "image_path": "images/page_6_table_15.jpg",
              "content": "<table><tbody><tr><td>Buttons</td><td>5072</td></tr><tr><td>+10,00,000</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>+1,00,000</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>+10,000</td><td></td></tr><tr><td>+1,000</td><td>5</td></tr><tr><td>+100</td><td>0</td></tr><tr><td>+10</td><td>6</td></tr><tr><td>+1</td><td>12</td></tr></tbody></table>"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 16,
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.793,
            0.847,
            0.831
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "2. Do you see any connection between each number and the corresponding smallest number of button clicks?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 17,
          "bbox": [
            0.15,
            0.836,
            0.801,
            0.892
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "3. If you notice, the expressions for the least button clicks also give the Indian place value notation of the numbers. Think about why this is so."
            }
          ]
        },
